---
import ContactCTA from '../../components/ContactCTA.astro';
import Portrait from '../../components/Portrait.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About Me | Timothée Sgroi" description="About Me Timothée Sgroi Lorem Ipsum">
    <div class="stack gap-20">
        <main class="wrapper about">
            <Portrait
                title="About Me"
                tagline="Thanks for stopping by! Read below to learn more about me and my background."
            >
                <img
                    width="1553"
                    height="873"
                    src="/assets/2019-09_Portrait.jpeg"
                    alt="Timothée Sgroi Portrait"
                />
            </Portrait>

            <section>
                <h2 class="section-title">Bachelor's in Computer Science</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        I am currently a final-year Bachelor's student in Computer Science at the Fribourg 
                        School of Engineering and Architecture (HEIA-FR). 
                    </p>    
                    <p>
                        This program offers courses along <b>3 different tracks</b>: Software Engineering, 
                        Networks and Systems, and Data Engineering; as well as core courses 
                        throughout the program.
                    </p>
                    <p> 
                        I chose the <b>Networks and Systems</b> track, as it best matches my interests 
                        and skills.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="section-title">Technical Professional Baccalaureate</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        I earned my technical professional baccalaureate in computer science at EPTM in Sion. 
                        This one-year program aims to complement the general knowledge, 
                        language, mathematics, and physics skills of students who have already obtained their CFC 
                        (Swiss vocational diploma).
                        <b>This opened the doors to universities of applied sciences</b> for me, 
                        whether in engineering or management fields.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <h2 class="section-title">CFC in Media Technology</h2>
                <div class="content">
                    <p>
                        I earned my CFC (Swiss vocational diploma) in Media Technology through a dual training program at Swisscom, combined with 
                        professional courses at EPTM in Sion. 
                        This training allowed me to develop skills primarily in the field of multimedia 
                        and communication, <b>but also in computer science</b>. It was this experience that gave me 
                        the desire to <b>specialize in this field</b>.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        <ContactCTA />
    </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .about {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 3.5rem;
    }

    img {
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }

    section {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--gray-200);
    }

    .section-title {
        grid-column-start: 1;
        font-size: var(--text-xl);
        color: var(--gray-0);
    }

    .content {
        grid-column: 2 / 4;
    }

    .content :global(a) {
        text-decoration: 1px solid underline transparent;
        text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
        transition: text-decoration-color var(--theme-transition);
    }

    .content :global(a:hover),
    .content :global(a:focus) {
        text-decoration-color: currentColor;
    }

    @media (min-width: 50em) {
        .about {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 60% 1fr;
        }

        .about > :global(:first-child) {
            grid-column-start: 2;
        }

        section {
            display: contents;
            font-size: var(--text-lg);
        }
    }
</style>